# ─── Frog Wire env ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Everything is OPTIONAL for local dev: with no keys set, the app seeds sample
# TCU articles into an in-memory store and renders a deterministic brief, so
# `npm run dev` works offline. Add keys to go live.

# Claude writes the daily brief. Without it, the deterministic fallback renders.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Cost-effective default; override to claude-sonnet-4-6 for richer prose.
BRIEF_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5-20251001

# Durable item + brief store. Without it, an in-memory store is used (fine for
# dev; in prod each serverless invocation is cold, so set these on Vercel).
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=

# Protects /api/cron/* and /api/refresh. On Vercel, set CRON_SECRET and Vercel
# Cron will send it as a Bearer token automatically. Empty = open (dev only).
CRON_SECRET=

# Override the source query feed if you want to tune it (football-only, etc.).
# GOOGLE_NEWS_FEED=https://news.google.com/rss/search?q=%22TCU%20football%22%20OR%20%22Horned%20Frogs%20football%22&hl=en-US&gl=US&ceid=US:en

# Reddit (social-buzz signal) — OAuth required as of 2025; optional, soft-skipped
# if absent. Register a "script" app at https://www.reddit.com/prefs/apps
# REDDIT_CLIENT_ID=
# REDDIT_CLIENT_SECRET=
# REDDIT_USER_AGENT=frog-wire/0.1 by your_reddit_username
